OL,3,AUK to review Chagos Islands deal after
OL,4,ATrump's latest criticism
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn April the deal, agreed under Sir
OL,7,FKeir Starmer, was paused indefinitely
OL,8,Fbecause Trump pulled his support.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
