OL,3,AUK to fight Russian disinformation and
OL,4,Apush new global AI standards, Burnham
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK will set up a new centre to
OL,8,F"stem the poisonous tide" of
OL,9,Fdisinformation, including from Russia,
OL,10,Fand lead efforts to establish global
OL,11,Fsafety standards for artificial
OL,12,Fintelligence, Prime Minister Andy
OL,13,FBurnham has said.
OL,15,FIn his first major international speech
OL,16,Fat the United Nations General Assembly
OL,17,Fin New York City, Burnham warned
OL,18,FRussian agencies are using "every means
OL,19,Fat their disposal", including bots and
OL,20,Ffake websites, to "spread lies and
OL,21,Fdisinformation".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
