OL,3,AUK economy will grow by less than
OL,4,Aexpected next year, OECD says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK will grow by less than expected
OL,7,Fnext year amid the ongoing US-Israel
OL,8,Fwar in Iran, an international agency
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FIt is one of many countries whose
OL,12,Feconomic prospects are facing a hit due
OL,13,Fto the prolonged conflict, the
OL,14,FOrganisation for Economic Co-operation
OL,15,Fand Development (OECD) said.
OL,17,FThe downgrade to the UK's economic
OL,18,Fgrowth outlook is moderate, according
OL,19,Fto the OECD, which predicted it will
OL,20,Fgrow by 1% in 2027, against an earlier
OL,21,Fforecast of 1.1%.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
