OL,3,AUK economy will grow by less than
OL,4,Aexpected next year, OECD says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe agency also upgraded the UK's
OL,7,Fgrowth outlook for 2026, from an
OL,8,Fexpected 0.9% to 1.1% for the year.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
