OL,3,ABurnham expects to find 'common ground'
OL,4,Awith Trump in first meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham said he expects to find
OL,7,F"common ground" with Donald Trump at
OL,8,Fthe pair's first face-to-face meeting
OL,9,Fon Tuesday.
OL,11,FThe prime minister and US president are
OL,12,Fin New York City for the annual
OL,13,Fgathering of world leaders at the
OL,14,FUnited Nations.
OL,16,FThe two men have spoken by phone twice
OL,17,Fsince Burnham became prime minister in
OL,18,FJuly, with Downing Street saying those
OL,19,Fcalls established a "productive
OL,20,Frelationship".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11910
SC,0010
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1790151959
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABurnham expects to find 'common ground'
OL,4,Awith Trump in first meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We've found a connection. So, I will
OL,7,Fgo with where I feel it's right, to
OL,8,Fmeet him where he is at, and search for
OL,9,Fthat common ground, which I'm sure
OL,10,Fwe'll find," the prime minister told
OL,11,Freporters on his flight to the US,
OL,12,Fadding "I'm looking forward to it."
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
